#### Intervention 8.2: Integrated Multi-Disciplinary Team (MDT) "Frequent Attender" Clinical Reviews (Clinical)
- **Mechanism**: Monthly cross-system MDT meetings (EM Consultant, GP, Psychiatrist, Social Worker, Addiction Specialist) to create individualized electronic treatment plans visible on ED registration.
